{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2023-05-23 09:51:00', 'title': 'AM BEST COMMENTS ON CREDIT RATINGS OF RENAISSANCERE HOLDINGS LTD. AND ITS MAIN SUBSIDIARIES FOLLOWING ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF VALIDUS REINSURANCE LTD.', 'text': "OLDWICK, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INSURANCE--AM BEST HAS COMMENTED THAT THE CREDIT RATINGS (RATINGS) OF RENAISSANCERE HOLDINGS LTD. (RENAISSANCERE) (BERMUDA) [NYSE: RNR] AND ITS VARIOUS AFFILIATED ENTITIES ARE UNCHANGED FOLLOWING RENAISSANCERE'S ANNOUNCEMENT FROM MAY 22, 2023, THAT IT HAD ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE THE TREATY REINSURANCE BUSINESS OF AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (AIG) (HEADQUARTERED IN NEW YORK, NY) [NYSE: AIG]. THE BUSINESS TO BE ACQUIRED BY RENAISSANCERE INCLUDES."}